            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "In the settlement of <strong>Rondonville</strong>, citizens are killed every night. Among the citizens there are dangerous criminals &quot;the Mafia&quot;. <br>The chaos begins.<br><br><strong><u>Basic gameplay</u></strong><br><br>Players are secretly assigned roles. In the game there are 2 warring teams: &quot;the Mafia&quot; and &quot;the Citizens&quot;. <br><br><strong>The Mafia team</strong><br><br><strong>Main roles</strong>:<br>The Mafia - during the night phase of the game, the Mafia choose an innocent to kill.<br><strong>Task</strong> - eliminate citizens.<br><br><strong>The Citizens team</strong><br><br><strong>Main roles</strong>:<br>The Doctor - defends others players at night.<br>The Sheriff - can detect whether a player is a Mafia and saves the player from killing the mafia.<br>The Citizen - during the day phase, all players debate the identities of the Mafia and vote to kill someone whom the majority suspect.<br><strong>Task</strong> - to liberate the settlement from the Mafia.<br><br>At the beginning of the game, players get a random role. Events depend on the progress of each player.<br>The game ends either when the last Mafia member is killed (Citizen victory) or the Mafia members outnumber or equal the Innocents during the day (Mafia victory).",
            "about_the_game": "In the settlement of <strong>Rondonville</strong>, citizens are killed every night. Among the citizens there are dangerous criminals &quot;the Mafia&quot;. <br>The chaos begins.<br><br><strong><u>Basic gameplay</u></strong><br><br>Players are secretly assigned roles. In the game there are 2 warring teams: &quot;the Mafia&quot; and &quot;the Citizens&quot;. <br><br><strong>The Mafia team</strong><br><br><strong>Main roles</strong>:<br>The Mafia - during the night phase of the game, the Mafia choose an innocent to kill.<br><strong>Task</strong> - eliminate citizens.<br><br><strong>The Citizens team</strong><br><br><strong>Main roles</strong>:<br>The Doctor - defends others players at night.<br>The Sheriff - can detect whether a player is a Mafia and saves the player from killing the mafia.<br>The Citizen - during the day phase, all players debate the identities of the Mafia and vote to kill someone whom the majority suspect.<br><strong>Task</strong> - to liberate the settlement from the Mafia.<br><br>At the beginning of the game, players get a random role. Events depend on the progress of each player.<br>The game ends either when the last Mafia member is killed (Citizen victory) or the Mafia members outnumber or equal the Innocents during the day (Mafia victory).",
            "short_description": "Mafia is Alive - team psychological turn-based role-playing game with a detective story.In the settlement of Rondonville, citizens are killed every night. Among the citizens there are dangerous criminals &quot;the Mafia&quot;. The chaos begins.At the beginning of the game, players get a random role.",
